  "prefLabel": "Jus 414.02 Director’s Authority",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 414.02 Director’s Authority. Nothing in these rules adopted by the department of justice shall limit or prevent the director from taking any action consistent with the director’s authority under RSA 7:19 through RSA 7:32-l.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
